   "guide": "Across older generations, Gram-positive activity generally falls while Gram-negative activity rises. Fourth generation extends third-generation Gram-negative coverage; fifth generation restores strong Gram-positive activity including MRSA; cefiderocol is a sixth-generation siderophore cephalosporin."
  },
